1.7 Key Features

The MHMR Data Processing Framework includes the following capabilities:

Incremental Data Processing
Row-Level Change Detection
Historical Data Maintenance
Snapshot Generation
Automated Retry Logic
Parallel Table Processing
Metadata-Driven Execution
Dynamic Table Handling
Detailed Audit Logging
Daily and Final Execution Logs
Backfill Support
Error Recovery
Atomic Snapshot Replacement
Timezone Support (CST/CDT and UTC)
Performance Optimization
Failure Isolation
1.8 Benefits

The implemented solution provides several operational and business benefits:

Reduces execution time by processing tables in parallel.
Eliminates full-table reloads through incremental processing.
Maintains complete historical records for compliance and analysis.
Provides accurate point-in-time snapshots for reporting.
Simplifies failure recovery using automated retry logic.
Enables monitoring through detailed execution logs.
Supports scalable processing for hundreds of tables.
Improves data consistency across downstream systems.
Reduces manual operational effort.
Provides a reusable framework that can be extended to additional source systems.
